Z||000000||Fiero5||05-11-2001||09:47 AM||||All we needed was my Dad in one of his GT's!<P>Marian, Stephen and I went out for Chinese as our two youngest were at Grandmas for dinner. <P>I arrived from work first<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Fiero9pass2.jpg"> <P>Then our son arrived<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Fiero9&sonspass1.jpg"> <P>Then Marian arrived from work<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/3_Fieros1.jpg"> <P>We had lots of people stop by to check them out. I think one guy even took some pics!<P>If I could only get my Mom into Fieros, then we could have 5 cruising around all at one time! That would be cool.<P>Steve<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FieroSSsignature1_1.jpg"> ||||reg||6
