Z||000008||AusFiero||05-12-2001||03:38 AM||||Only takes 1 Fiero for em to stare in Australia. Don't need a group  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <P>Hell I think I will stare too if I ever see another one on the road. We might have 3 or 400 of em here but seeing them is a rarity.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero.gif"> <BR>When I was young I spent 80% of my money on Women, Gambling and Alcohol. I guess I wasted the rest.||||reg||1
